Passion fruit', 'Subtropical passion fruit is a vine species of passionflower grown mainly in New Zealand, Israel and Sri Lanka. Contains vitamin A, beta-carotene and potassium, has a toning effect on our bodies. One fruit weighs an average 90g.'),
